      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Today you will go on a journey to the Blue Lagoon (\"lagoa azul\") and the surrounding beaches.\n\nThe Blue Lagoon is a paradise with calm, shallow water with various shades of blue. The lagoon is also home to many small, colorful fish. \n\nSIB Tours and Transfers in Ilha Grande (no guide)"
